        "raw": "<p>reverse Marjorie Mittermier would be Tourist an unasuming unremarkable granny with a magic ticket that gets her in to any location or event with payed admission</p>\r\n\r\n<p>backwards Scholar would be Student a skill mimic quick learner that gets trained by every hero he can meet. And of course by mentoring young Johnny they learn to better them selves, his journry will never end he will never become a master but he helps where he can and brings out the best in others&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>oposite day Parse instead of a living computer could be a mechanical machine as a person able to turn off he brain and perception going on auto pilot ignoring pain, emotions, exhaustion, and any feints or distractions&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>inverse power Naturalist could have a collection of awakened animal familliars, not a man becoming a beast but beasts becoming like men&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Profesor Purification could be mini nemisis and ex GF of inverse Naturalist. destroying the needed microbes in the human body and the soil used in agriculture also an expert at cleansing crime scenes&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
